 left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a>:</b> Items made of <b>gem</b> are generally extremely durable and have a very high <a href=\"/page/Hardness\" title=\"Hardness\">hardness</a>. Most commonly used to make trinkets and docents.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">13\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0001350000</span>1,350<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">0.25 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Endgame:_The_Archbishop%27s_Fate\" title=\"Endgame: The Archbishop&#39;s Fate\">Endgame: The Archbishop's Fate</a></b>, End chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Maximum_Charge_Tier\" title=\"Maximum Charge Tier\">Maximum Charge Tier</a>: II</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Light_Spirals\" title=\"Light Spirals\">Light Spirals</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Lesser_Undead_Guard\" title=\"Lesser Undead Guard\">Lesser Undead&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Lesser_Undead_Guard\" title=\"Lesser Undead Guard\">Lesser Undead&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This armor burns those Undead that attack the wearer, causing 1d8 Good damage on a successful melee attack.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\"> False Life +8</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\"> False Life +8</a>:</b> +8 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to hit points.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span> and/or <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Shield Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Shield Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Light I<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Light I: Wearing this Rune Arm will imbue any weapon you wield, dealing 1d2 points of light damage per hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Craftable_Rune_Arm\" title=\"Craftable Rune Arm\">Craftable Rune Arm</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: left;\">This Rune Arm is craftable and can be customized using recipes at standard crafting devices after disjuncting.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Essence_Crafting\" title=\"Essence Crafting\">Essence Crafting</a> \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><i>Valisk of Thrane hated tombs, but his adventuring companions enthusiastically hunted the undead. He crafted this rune arm from various items he found to protect himself from the abominations.</i>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p>Candlelight after disjuction:\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Candlelight_disjuncted.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Candlelight_disjuncted.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"438\" height=\"776\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span><br />\nCandlelight when worn:\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Candlelight_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Candlelight_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"212\" height=\"203\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Candlelight.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Candlelight.png/420px-Candlelight.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"771\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Candlelight.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817035328\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.092 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.149 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5181/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38163/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9566/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 20/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  126.059      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  126.059      1 -total\n 96.09%  121.132      1 Template:Named_Rune_Arm\n 65.78%   82.925     55 Template:IO\n 23.15%   29.185      1 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 22.12%   27.882      1 Template:IsLamannia\n 21.40%   26.979      8 Template:Popup\n 20.73%   26.134      1 Template:IsSpeculation\n 19.00%   23.953      1 Template:InCategory\n 18.32%   23.089      1 Template:Non-food\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:17835-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817035328 and revision id 682834. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
